<title>AUSTRALIA: S&amp;P rates St George notes A-minus.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates St George notes A-minus.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it has assigned its A-minus long-term rating to St George Bank Ltd's US$150 million subordinated note offering.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the rating outlook is stable.</p>
</text>
